nt-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">이상 취득</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:45.4pt;text-indent:-45.4pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 4~6</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">학기를 이수한 휴학생 중 다음 학기 복학 예정자도 전과 신청 가능 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:146.2pt;text-indent:-146.2pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">전과 허가 후 복학하지 않을 경우 전과 허가가 취소됨</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:36.5pt;text-indent:-36.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">전과 제외자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">재직자특별전형 입학자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">편입생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:36.5pt;text-indent:-36.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">전공변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">동일 학부 내의 다른 전공으로 변경하려는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">학년생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:7.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">전과</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">전공변경 심사 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">첨부의&nbsp;전과·전공변경 선발방법 및 심사기준 참조. 세부사항은 해당 학과(전공)에 문의&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:7.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">허용 인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">입학정원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">전공별 배정정원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">30% </span><span style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">범위 내에서 학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -36.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 13pt;\">에서 정함(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; text-indent: -48.6667px;\">첨부 심사기준 참조)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:7.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">참고 사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:38.5pt;text-indent:-38.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.9pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">전과</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.9pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.9pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">전공변경 신청 자격에는 성적 기준이 없으나 학과별 전출입 심사 시 성적 기준 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">전과</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">전공변경한 자는 전입 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">의 교육과정을 따르며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">전입 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;\">전체 학년 교육과정</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.6pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">의 필수과목을 모두 이수하여야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:38.5pt;text-indent:-38.5pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">전과</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-hansi-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">‧</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">전공변경 확정일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: 2025. 1. 20.(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:13.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font